{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260pweF80TeN1793676931.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>運輸署指咪表泊車系統故障，正緊急搶修。</p><p></p><p>在九龍城廣播道，有咪表顯示「沒有服務」，部分就仍然運作。承辦商在事發後搶修，重新啟動系統，之後回復正常。在灣仔、油麻地等亦有同樣情況。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PARKING-1100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iLkNFgiC6c1793676928.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>運輸署早上約8時20分，接獲營運商報告指咪表系統故障，署方即時責成營運商從速修復，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PARKING-1100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ogm1aN9HXN1793676924.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:23:05.148325+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:46.911459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:46.911459+00:00","content_hash":"31ea4d86bdfc1c65f05e5bd092c11db6e8788813216f793e0c79677d756e812a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}